## Program Outcome

Tool Shed can determine quickly and recoverably whether any durable actionable element and its
complete governing subtree are closed. Versioned child envelopes and parent-owned requirements
rebuild exact lineage; guarded database projections provide fast traversal and status; independent
recursive evaluation detects drift; proof and recovery operations remain bounded by authority; and
the result is qualified across hosted-development, Linux, and Windows before any later production
promotion.

